# These projects open on Windows, macOS, and Linux.
#
# The index holds LF. Godot writes LF. A Windows checkout runs
# core.autocrlf=true and writes CRLF, so the tree and the editor disagree over
# the same files. Git reports them as modified, and the directory never stays
# clean. This rule forces LF on every platform.

* text=auto eol=lf

# Importer metadata. Godot writes these files with LF.
*.import text eol=lf

# Binary assets. Git must not translate these bytes.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ogg binary
*.wav binary
*.mp3 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.zip binary
*.exe binary
